DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gut, dass du wieder da bist.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sieht ganz so aus, als wärst
du erfolgreich gewesen!{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, gut.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich hatte so ein Gefühl,
dass du demnächst hier sein
würdest.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Whew!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} When you didn't come back,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I thought something bad might have
happened.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Qué alegría que estés de vuelta!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Como ha pasado tanto rato,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}estaba un pelín preocupada.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Meno male!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Non ti vedevo tornare
e{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} temevo ti fosse successo
qualcosa.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Puh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Als du länger nicht zurück-
gekommen bist, dachte ich schon,
irgendetwas sei passiert.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Che mi vuoi dire?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} La tua richiesta
sembrava urgentissimissima,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sorry to call you over for such a
small matter,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but I wanted to return
this to you.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Siento haberte hecho venir hasta
aquí, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pero es que quería devolverte
lo que me prestaste.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Désolée de t'avoir fait venir en
urgence pour une vétille, mais il
fallait vraiment que je te rende ça...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Excuse-moi per averti chiamata
per una sciocchezza,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma volevo
restituirti questa cosa.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tut mir leid, dass ich dich wegen so
einer Kleinigkeit störe,{{TAG:0003:0001:}} aber ich
wollte dir das hier zurückgeben.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Böyle ufak bir şey için seni buraya
çağırdığım için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama bunu
sana geri vermek istedim.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, right!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} I hope you found it useful.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You can borrow it again anytime
you'd like.

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah, oui !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} J'espère que ça t'a servi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
N'hésite pas à me redemander si tu
en as à nouveau besoin !

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, de rien!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Spero ti sia servita.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se ne hai di nuovo bisogno posso
portartela in qualsiasi momento.

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu vas voir, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}, je ne t'ai
pas fait venir pour rien. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Attends-
toi à une surprise de taille...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich habe dich gerufen, weil ich dir
etwas geben wollte, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Etwas Tolles!
Etwas, das du sicher nützlich
finden wirst, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I'm sorry for the sudden summons.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I was cleaning up my house
yesterday when I found this.
I saw "Property of {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}" was
written on it and thought you might
need it ASAP.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Seni birdenbire çağırdığım için özür dilerim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dün evimi toplarken bunu buldum.
Üzerinde “{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}’a aittir” yazıyordu,
ben de acilen lazım olabilir diye düşündüm.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I've just finished the
most amazing book!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I had to tell
you about it right away.
{{TAG:0005:001D:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Isn't that a cool title?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I can't wait
to discuss it with you later.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}, je viens de finir le plus
grand chef-d'œuvre de l'histoire de
la littérature et des arts en général !
{{TAG:0005:001D:0000}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Rien que le titre est ébouriffant de
génie !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} J'ai hâte qu'on en discute !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ho letto un libro
fantastique!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Devo prestartelo.
"{{TAG:0005:001D:0000}}".{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Non è un titolo charmant?
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Non vedo l'ora di parlarne
con te quando l'avrai finito.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} az önce inanılmaz güzel bir
kitap bitirdim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sana hemen anlatmam gerekiyordu.
{{TAG:0005:001D:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Sence de havalı bir ad değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sonra
üzerine konuşmak için sabırsızlanıyorum.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sorry for the frantic summons,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.you know that crossword
puzzle you mailed me?
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I'm stuck on the very last answer in
the puzzle.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Thirty-two across!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Böyle telaşla çağırdığım için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.bana yolladığın şu bulmacayı
hatırlıyor musun?
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bulmacanın en son cevabında takıldım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yatay otuz iki!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Excuse-moi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma ora devo andare.
Ho lasciato i biscotti in forno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000C:0005:}}A bientôt, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Allez, je ne vous dérange pas plus
longtemps, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} et toi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bonne journée !

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich mache mich dann mal wieder
auf die Socken. Bis dann!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Tschüss, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!
